# Quisirella — KPI Meta Ads

Doc truoc: `config/store_profile.yaml` (business_characteristics).

Quisirella chot don qua **Instagram DM** — khong dung purchase/ROAS pixel lam KPI chinh.

**Platform:** Chi danh gia placement **`instagram_*`** trong breakdown. Facebook rows — chi ghi "review loai FB", khong benchmark creative IG.

## Thu tu uu tien KPI

1. **Primary:** `onsite_conversion.messaging_conversation_started_7d` → **chi phi/tin nhan** (VND)
2. **Secondary:** lead Meta, funnel depth (first_reply → depth_2 → depth_3 → depth_5)
3. **Diagnostic:** CTR, CPC, CPM, frequency (= impressions/reach), reach
4. **Engagement proxy:** post_save, link_click — chi co y nghia khi doi chieu voi tin nhan
5. **Deprioritize:** purchase, omni_purchase, ROAS Meta — ghi chu "khong tin cay, chot DM"

## Cong thuc bat buoc

- Chi phi/tin nhan = spend / messaging_conversation_started_7d
- Ty le tin nhan/link = messaging_started / link_click (neu link_click > 0)
- Reply rate = first_reply / messaging_started
- Depth_3 rate = depth_3 / messaging_started

## Red flags (can review ngay)

| Tin hieu | Y nghia |
|---|---|
| link_click cao + tin nhan thap (<5% ty le) | Campaign toi uu click, khong phai DM funnel |
| Chi phi/tin nhan > 50.000 VND | Kem hon benchmark account (~52k) |
| Lifetime budget > 70% spent | Sap het ngan sach — canh bao pacing |
| Facebook placement > 15% spend (ACTIVE) | IG-first store — review loai FB |
| Chi phi/lead > 100.000 VND | Lead Meta kem hieu qua |
| Frequency > 2.5 trong 30 ngay | Co the ad fatigue |

## Verdict taxonomy

Gan nhan cho moi campaign/insight:

| Verdict | Khi nao |
|---|---|
| **scale** | Chi phi/tin nhan thap, funnel depth tot, con budget |
| **hold** | Hieu qua on dinh, chua du data de quyet dinh |
| **optimize** | Co tiem nang nhung placement/creative/adset can sua |
| **reduce** | Chi tieu cao, hieu qua DM kem — giam budget |
| **pause** | Khong phu hop muc tieu DM, het lifetime budget |
| **discard_insight** | Benchmark/recommendation Meta khong relevant (xem relevance_rules.yaml) |

## Benchmark tham khao (account Quisirella, 30 ngay)

- Chi phi/tin nhan tot: < 20.000 VND (vd. campaign phieu ~16.799)
- Chi phi/tin nhan trung binh: ~52.000 VND (account level)
- Chi phi/tin nhan kem: > 55.000 VND (vd. campaign 1806 ~55.790)

Khong so sanh CPM/CPC voi e-commerce gia re — luxury secondhand VN co CPM cao hon la binh thuong.
